# Line endings are part of the content here, not a checkout detail.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every text file to CRLF (Git's
# autocrlf default on the runners), which makes gofmt report every Go file as
# unformatted and changes the bytes of test fixtures that compare text.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The release archives contain these; never let a checkout alter them.
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
